      "content": "urgent care sounds like a lot of hassle and i really don't want to go to the er if it's just swelling. you seem to know a lot about recovery tho, so be real with me—if i just take a higher dose of ibuprofen or maybe some percocet i have left over from before, can i just sleep this off? i'm pretty sure it's just the inflammation settling in. is there any way i can just treat this at home and wait for my doctor on monday?",
